<div class="in"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="SoBD"><div class="eyebrow">Concept mockup · November 2026</div><h1>Back Office<br><span>Showcase</span></h1>
<p>Eight working areas for running the State of Black Design: projects, knowledge, brand approvals and the team. Choose an area to open it. Every page links to the others.</p></div></header>
<main><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-01-Overview.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Overview area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">01</span><h2>Overview</h2><p>Today at a glance: quick access, headline counts, this week's tasks, the Stakes Is High countdown, milestones, recent files and team activity.</p><span class="go">Open Overview →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-02-Projects.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Projects area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">02</span><h2>Projects</h2><p>Every program as a project. Drag tasks across a board, tick off milestones, switch to a task list, and see the files linked to each project.</p><span class="go">Open Projects →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-03-Knowledge-Library.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Knowledge Library area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">03</span><h2>Knowledge Library</h2><p>Twelve collections for brand files, events, sponsors, press and governance. Upload by drag and drop, search, filter, star, tag and move files.</p><span class="go">Open Knowledge Library →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-04-Guides.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Guides & Playbooks area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">04</span><h2>Guides &amp; Playbooks</h2><p>The brand guide turned into short playbooks: voice and tone, naming, message hierarchy, boilerplate, co-branding, sponsor tiers, accessibility and social.</p><span class="go">Open Guides &amp; Playbooks →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-05-Brand-Approvals.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Brand Approvals area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">05</span><h2>Brand Approvals</h2><p>The review queue for co-branded pieces, merch, press releases and theme graphics, with the 5-business-day deadline counted down.</p><span class="go">Open Brand Approvals →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-06-Calendar.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Calendar area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">06</span><h2>Calendar</h2><p>Milestones and due dates across every project on one month view, color-coded by project, through Stakes Is High in February 2027.</p><span class="go">Open Calendar →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-07-Team.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the Team area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">07</span><h2>Team</h2><p>Who is on the team, what each person leads, their open tasks, and anything overdue.</p><span class="go">Open Team →</span></div></a><a class="card" href="SoBD-Back-Office-08-My-Account.html"><div class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Screenshot of the My Account area"></div><div class="body"><span class="num">08</span><h2>My Account</h2><p>Profile name and role shown across the back office, plus a reset for the sample data.</p><span class="go">Open My Account →</span></div></a></div>
<footer><span>Built to the SoBD Brand Guidelines v2. Sample data only; changes save in your browser.</span><span>Elevating Black Voices. Creating Opportunities. Leading Change.</span></footer></main></body></html>
